- (Current hypothesis) The bug is caused by incorrect handling of Integer.MIN_VALUE in the greatestCommonDivisor method. The method attempts to negate negative numbers, but Integer.MIN_VALUE cannot be negated without overflow, leading to incorrect results in edge cases.

